{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yuanzhang-e-o188","title":"王烈以典籍娱心育人为务，建学校敦崇庠序，诱人不因其性气诲之以道，州闾成风咸竞为善","accounts":[{"id":"yuanzhang-a-96906ae69be9776b755c","label":"裴注·先贤行状","text":"王烈以典籍娱心育人为务，建学校敦崇庠序，诱人不因其性气诲之以道，州闾成风咸竞为善","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-9aacf0698e196347a5cf"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-23908bd11fa420406661","label":"裴注·先贤行状","text":"时人或讼曲直将质于王烈，或至途而返或望庐而还，皆相推以直不敢使烈闻之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-d9dceb7d1d1d50b8ec7a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"yuanzhang-p0055","role":"建学校敦崇庠序，诱人不因其性气诲之以道，使从善远恶，州闾成风咸竞为善；国人讼曲直者至途而返、望庐而还，不敢使其闻之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-9aacf0698e196347a5cf","yuanzhang-q-d9dceb7d1d1d50b8ec7a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-9aacf0698e196347a5cf","yuanzhang-q-d9dceb7d1d1d50b8ec7a"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-9aacf0698e196347a5cf","source_order":[11,366,146],"order":2653}],"persons":[{"id":"yuanzhang-p0055","name":"王烈","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yuanzhang-q-9aacf0698e196347a5cf","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-c27ab87dce7b52f3c0ca","layer":"pei","quote":"以典籍娱心，育人为务；遂建学校，敦崇庠序。其诱人也，皆不因其性气，诲之以道；使之从善远恶，益者不自觉；而大化隆行，皆成宝器。门人出入，容止可观；时在市井，行步有异；人皆别之。州闾成风，咸竞为善","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":365,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1c3fb2dab7aaee29c0cd","start":146,"end":242,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-d9dceb7d1d1d50b8ec7a","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-c27ab87dce7b52f3c0ca","layer":"pei","quote":"时人或讼曲直，将质于烈；或至途而返，或望庐而还；皆相推以直，不敢使烈闻之","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":365,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1c3fb2